Imported code
-------------

mail-alias-sync/adm_mail.php, pgacc/adm_names.php, pgacc/accsync.php and
pgacc/lgfmail.sh were imported unchanged from PPOE/admidio-old, a fork of Admidio that is distributed under the GNU General Public License
version 2 (it ships Admidio's license text). The files themselves carry no
license statement of their own; they are included here under the same terms.
Their copyright remains with their author, as recorded in the history of
PPOE/admidio-old.
